From db2a50bfa5d7783e44d5ff9ef2ffe47042d7ef13 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pestopoppa <72076821+pestopoppa@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:51:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] launch_affinity: every thread of a pinned launch stays on
 its placement (ROCr knob + re-pin + status assertion)

Finding (workspace-58, 2026-10-22): a `taskset -c 184-191 numactl --membind=3`
HIP llama-server had 196 threads; 195 read Cpus_allowed_list 184-191, ONE early
ROCr thread read 0-191. Cause, read from the installed ROCr
(/opt/rocm/lib/libhsa-runtime64.so.1.14.60200, ROCm 6.2.0): os::CreateThread
fills a cpu_set with 0..get_nprocs_conf()-1 and passes it to
pthread_attr_setaffinity_np when a runtime flag is set; the flag is parsed from
HSA_OVERRIDE_CPU_AFFINITY_DEBUG and is true unless the value is exactly "0".

Three layers, one shared helper (scripts/server/launch_affinity.py):
1. apply_pinned_launch_env: a spawn whose prefix pins (taskset -c) gets
   HSA_OVERRIDE_CPU_AFFINITY_DEBUG=0, so ROCr threads (now and later) inherit
   the pinned mask. Inert for CPU binaries.
2. enforce_launch_affinity / pin_all_tasks after health: re-pin any task whose
   mask is not inside the placement (sub-mask OpenMP places are left alone),
   repeat until clean, and FAIL the launch (kill OUR pid) if a task still
   escapes. Only acts on a direct child of the launcher (prove OUR pid).
3. affinity_attestation_warnings in `orchestrator_stack.py status` and
   runtime_attestation_warnings: every task of the live pid must be inside the
   port's declared placement; generate_attestation no longer passes a row
   because ONE task (or the main thread) matches -- task_cpu_escape is
   reported as cpu_affinity_escape.

Wired into all six start_server llama-server branches and start_aux_service,
plus the serving gate (env + post-health pin + post-warm-up re-check recorded
as affinity_escapes_at_stop).

NOT DEPLOYED: stack-change package for one operator signature (root branch
ws58/gpu-host-thread-pinning-20261022). No production kernel touched.

Tests: tests/unit/test_launch_affinity.py (34) + adjacent launch/attestation
files: 316 passed. test_stack_change_pipeline.py has 2 failures in untouched
promotion-gate code (uv-run command shape), unrelated to this change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
